    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67236" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετρ-ητός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>measurable</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμετρος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				820c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. πρὸς ἄλληλα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				819e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Plt.</u>
				284b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένθος οὐ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1244
